window.products.push({"id":141027,"name":"Portable Washing Machine, Ozone & Blue Light Deep Clean Mini Washing Machine, Smart Timer Control Washer Machine, Portable Washer for Socks and Tiny T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rGFIkIyVL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"【Live a Healthier Life】- This portable washing machine have stylish and small appearance compared with others. It is designed specially for socks and baby cloths. As Scientists suggested, there are much invisible bacterium on our socks and socks have better be washed separately. Special speed design make better coordination with sonic washing to achieve better clean effect. 【Mini Portable Washing Machine】- Mini Shape do not mean small capacity. This mini portable washing machine features 3.8 lbs. wash capacity. It can wash 1-2 underwears/2-3 baby clothes /3-4 adult socks/5-6 baby socks at the same times. Please Note: This camping washing machine is used for some small and delicate items. Please don’t put some heavy items like sweaters and bed sheet. 【Ozone & Blue light】- This small washing machines for apartments own Ozone and Blue light double deep washing protection. Double washing protection brought users cleaner socks and more healthy life. Let bacterium far away from us. These are especially important for baby. 【Smart Control Washing Machine】- This tiny washing machine work totally 15 minutes each time and it will stop working automatically. Mini laundry machine have Bidirectional rotation work mode and each direction turn three circles, then switch to the opposite. The whole process needn’t manual operation. 【Ultrasonic Auxiliary Washing】- This mini portable washing machine utilize ultrasonic to make dirt drop from sock, especially dirt in crevice which is difficult to be removed. We strongly recommend to add laundry detergent into water, then put soaks in and soak for 10 minutes before turn on washing machine. That will make better effect on washing. 【Convenient to use】- This portable washing machine adopt one button control design. Users just put finger on button for 2 seconds, the washer machine will turn on right now. Filter on the top of washing machine is helpful for users to pour dirty water after using. Handle is convenient for users to change water as well.In addition, this washing machine enable users to cover it for preventing water overflowing. Mini Shape do not mean small capacity. It can wash 3-5 socks at the same times.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rGFIkIyVL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honadar","source_asin":"B09VP5D86P","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-141027","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VP5D86P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VP5D86P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
