window.products.push({"id":141138,"name":"bev-tek The Performance Pint Stainless Steel Travel Mug Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ns14WsmlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Bev-Tek Performance Pint is taking offices by storm from Austin to Silicon Valley. Want to know why? Modern professional life is busy and the pace keeps getting faster! Everyday you have to get the kids to school, navigate the commute, get the deliverables out the door on time, attend SO MANY meetings, get back home, make dinner and be in bed by a reasonable hour so you can do it all again. It’s pretty exhausting. That’s why it’s important to savor the simple things in life like a steaming hot cup of your favorite coffee or a refreshing cold glass of microbrew. It’s the little things right? But a cup of coffee loses its heat in just 20 minutes in a ceramic mug. When was the last time you had 20 uninterrupted minutes to enjoy a beverage? Can’t remember? That’s where Bev-Tek comes in: Top Performer: The Bev-Tek Performance Pint uses the magic of vacuum insulation to deliver over 18 TIMES the thermal performance of regular mugs and glasses. Superior Aesthetics: Are you a tastemaker? Want to be one? The Performance Pint is the rare performance tumbler that actually has style. Turn heads wherever you go with one of our Jet Set Black or Cornflower Blue mugs. No Dripping: The Performance Pint eliminates condensation. Put your drink on any surface without fearing the consequences. No Slipping: The Performance Pint’s sleek matte finish provides a solid grip to accommodate all hand sizes. Safe: The Performance Pint is made from BPA-free, food grade stainless steel. How do we know? We test our products in the USA to make sure our materials are healthy. Do our competitors? Lifetime warranty for defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ns14WsmlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OKcafe","source_asin":"B0197OS86M","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-141138","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0197OS86M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0197OS86M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
