window.products.push({"id":141145,"name":"MG Coffee Stainless Steel Dolce Gusto Refillable Capsules Coffee Filters Reusable Coffee Pods Compatible for Dolce Gusto Mini Me Genio Piccolo Esperta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vjvDoxhpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ABOUT US As we all know, Crema is part of the Espresso coffee, most capsules in the markets can not make coffee cream.  Here is our reusable Dolce Gusto capsule CREMA VERSION. After several months of research, our technical team had solved this complex technical problem.  Whatever the size of the ground coffee, this pod allows you to make a cup of real coffee ESPRESSO WITH CRéMA. If you are interested in CREMA, our capsule is the best choice for you. Tips: 1) If by mistake happens to make an extra hole (with the needle) on the cup just cover with scotch tape and you can still use the capsule  2) Use Espresso grind for best results with cream. Tried different amounts of coffee in the pod to brew you favorite taste, but do not exceed 3/4 cup 3)The reusable capsule fits tightly, sometimes maybe too tight, in fact is kind of difficult to take it out, the best way is pushing the bottom part with your finger and it will pop out, but careful it could be still hot. QUSTIONS & ANSWERS Q: Can I put milk powder in this capsule? A: Do not recommend it. Milk powder may have an insoluble phenomenon with boiled water, sometimes it will plug the mesh. Q:how to correct put into the dolce gusto capsul? A: the hole must be put 6 o'clock way. could out the coffee","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vjvDoxhpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MG Coffee","source_asin":"B071ZS1C1B","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-141145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071ZS1C1B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B071ZS1C1B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
