window.products.push({"id":141321,"name":"Kleanbrew by Artisan Barista - Reusable Stainless Steel Filter for Hario V60 01 Coffee Maker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510yMdwNgCL._AC_.jpg","description":"This is a high quality stainless steel metal V60 filter to brew great coffee with the V60 1 cup coffee maker. Stop worrying about running out of paper filters by using our Metal Filter for V60 01 Cup. It's designed to last forever and serve you and your need for high quality grit-free & smooth coffee. This Metal Filter for V60 is easy to use. Please follow these instructions to get the most out of your cup of coffee. Step 1: Boil twice as much water as you’ll need for the brewing. About 600-700ml. Step 2: Now weight the coffee: 25-30 are enough. Step 3: Grind your coffee while the water is heating. Grind it about as coarse as sea salt. Step 4: Take your Artisan Barista Kleanbrew V60 Metal Filter and put it in the V60. Step 6: Next, pour about ½ of the hot water over all the inner parts of the porcelain. The water will heat your cup. Let the rest of the water sit in the kettle until it’s about 200 degrees Fahrenheit. Step 7: Now, pour the grounds in the filter and shake it slightly. That should flatten the coffee to allow a more even pour. Step 8: Afterwards, pour twice the amount of water in the grounds center. If you have 25 grams of coffee, pour in 50 grams of water. Work your way outwards gently. Avoid pouring water down the sides of the filter. The coffee will expand (bloom) after that. Allow it to bloom for about 45 seconds. Continue pouring into the center of the grounds.  Pour at a rate that the whole brewing process takes about 2,5 - 3 minutes. Altogether, there should be about 350g of water. Last step: Enjoy! Click \"ADD TO CART\" to improve your V60 Coffee and stop wasting money with our V60 Reusable Filter","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510yMdwNgCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artisan Barista","source_asin":"B00XR1ZEDM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-141321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XR1ZEDM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XR1ZEDM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
