window.products.push({"id":141478,"name":"ZAFRO Ice&Cold&Hot Ice Makers Countertop with Water Dispenser, 12 Cubes in 7 Mins 44Lbs/24H Stainless Steel Bullet Ice Maker Suitable for Home Office ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":284.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uEacGtb6L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧊【Fast Ice Making & 3 Temperature Setting】ZAFRO high-tech water dispenser has not only crisp cold water and warm hot water output, but also bullet ice output. Hot water & ice & cold water, three modes can be synchronized. You can also use this water dispenser as an ice maker. It makes 12pcs ice in 6-10 minutes on average 🧊【2 Ways to Add Water】 Our unique countertop water dispenser supports two ways of adding water, manual or bottled water supply. It suitable for 3-5 gallon bottled water, you can also manually pour 3.2L of water from the top 🧊【Material Structure & Easy To Operate】ZAFRO water dispenser and ice maker machine is equipped with an intelligent control panel and indicator lights, so you can easily enjoy water and ice just by pressing a button.100% stainless steel protects water purity in hot and cold reservoirs while maintaining cooler longevity 🧊【Compact Ice Maker】Portable automatic ice maker with size of 16*10*18in, no hookup required, suitable for home office kitchen or a boat, a motor home. Save more space 🧊【Safe & Easy to Clean】The child safety lock features prevents accidental dispensing of hot water, so the entire family can use it worry-free. Clean the water reservoir and make sure to remove the hot water drain plug on the unit bottom to drain the water completely","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uEacGtb6L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZAFRO","source_asin":"B0CF8R92J6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-141478","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CF8R92J6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0CF8R92J6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":141479,"name":"SUPER DEAL Full Automatic Washing Machine 2-in-1 Portable Compact Laundry Washer & Spin Combo with 10 Preset Programs 8 Water Levels for Apartments, R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DWkHUt32L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"『Full Automatic Washer』The portable laundry machine comes with one fully automatic cycle programmed to deliver the best washing and rinsing performance, and protect the clothes no matter if you’re washing super dirty jeans or the most delicate wool. Once you set the program, just leave it alone to work and do your own staffs. Adjust different washing modes and water levels with control panel freely. It’s a washer that does exactly what you want, the way you want. 『Offer Better Functions』This new version automatic washing machine designed with an all-in-one LED display control panel that contains 10 preset programs, 8 water levels and 5 time range of air dry for selection to meet your different needs of clothes cleaning and saves water. All functions are listed clearly so you can easily click the button to start your laundry in home. 『Large Load Capacity』8 LBS Large Load Capacity. Ample, honeycomb shaped inner tub can load 10 lbs at one time, which is big enough for several items at once, and will even accommodate larger garments like pairs of jeans or bed sheets. Which is great if you and your family members need something cleaned quickly for work the next day or for a night out. 『Long Power Cord&Hoses Included』Comes with a 59 inches extra long power cord, 65.3 inches inlet hose and 63 inches drain hose, which can better suit your needs of reaching the far outlet or sink faucet to do laundry. All accessories and instruction are put inside the washer tub when packaging for safety transportation. 『High Quality & Wide Application』Constructed of updated high-density PP plastic body + Premium ABS lid + High quality stainless steel tub + Newest powerful aluminum motor, make it well built to use for years. Compact and lightweight design let you can move it to anywhere and fit it into a bathroom or closet easily. Perfect for dorms, apartments, condos, motor homes, RV’s, camping trips or anywhere with limited space! NOTE: Feel free to contact the seller if you have any product/setting issues!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DWkHUt32L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPER DEAL","source_asin":"B08DV43LFD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-141479","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DV43LFD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DV43LFD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
