window.products.push({"id":141494,"name":"CAPMESSO Reusable Capsules for Nespresso OriginalLine, 6pcs Nespresso Refillable Pods Stainless Steel Coffee Pods Compatible with Nespresso Originalin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m0MVFROcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Nespresso Originalline Compatible]- These reusable nespresso pods are precisely designed for Nespresso Originalline machine, includes Nespresso U;Pixie;Le Cube;Maestria;Lattissima;Inissia;Concept;Essenza Mini and Citiz(not Fit For Citiz EN267,D110,Essenza C100,Essenza Mini D30;Inissia C40,Le Cube D185 & C185,Krups CitiZ XN740B and Prodigio Krups,).*Not affiliated with Nespresso. [Premium Quality for Assure Coffee] Our nespresso refillable pod is made of food-grade stainless steel, anti-rust, wear-resistant,safe, healthy and long lasting(up to 10,000 times!). The capsule wall is in superior hardness,featuring foil lids with strong glue for sealing,extracting fully and precipitating with crema at high temperature, preserving the freshness and mellowness of the coffee. [Prefilled & Fresh Preserving Wood Tray]- Delicate and premium wood tray with 6pcs rubber holders, which can easily prefill and store 6pcs nespresso refillable pods at one time.The reusable nespresso pods are sealed in airtight rubber holder, protecting and preserving coffee quality, freshness, and intensity that can last for 7 days. Get ready to use anytime! [Price & Planet wise] if you use these nespresso pods reusable solely you wind up saving money in the long run and can use whatever your favorite coffee is. They help ease the burden of trash by only replacing the disposable foil seal,lower the cost to brew each cup and make a contribution to protect our homeland. [Easy to Customized & Brew] Easily fill with a scoopful of your own dark roasted fine grinds to the refillable capsules and lightly tamp down,apply aluminum foil lids on top. Redefine your coffee within minutes! No mess guarantee! Without any sticky residue to affect next use. [A hit and miss kit] Considerate gift choice: 1 delicate wood tray with 6pcs airtight rubber holder; 6pcs reusable coffee capsules for Nespresso Originalline; 100pcs aluminum foils lids;scoop for filling.The most affordable set in our store.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m0MVFROcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAPMESSO","source_asin":"B0BQMFNHZK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-141494","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQMFNHZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQMFNHZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
