window.products.push({"id":141544,"name":"Beaquicy 280145 W10820039 Washer hub kit replacement part for Whirlpool Kenmore Maytag Cabrio Bravo Oasis Washing Machine - Replaces 8545948 8545953 W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613oLhVmphL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ 𝐒𝐔𝐏𝐏𝐎𝐑𝐓 𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝐃𝐀𝐘𝐒 𝐑𝐄𝐓𝐔𝐑𝐍 & 𝐄𝐗𝐂𝐇𝐀𝐍𝐆𝐄- 𝐑𝐈𝐒𝐊-𝐅𝐑𝐄𝐄 𝐒𝐇𝐎𝐏𝐏𝐈𝐍𝐆. Beaquicy attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.If you have any quality problem during warranty period,please contact customer service in time.Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✦【W10820039 WASHER DRIVE HUB KIT】-- The 280145 washer hub kit Included 1 x Driver Hub & 2 x Driven Basket Hubs, which need to be used in combination.W10820039 washer hub is part of the washer drive system, which connects the mixer to the transmission.▶Replace number:PD00024069,8545948,8545953,W10118114,1200151,AP3892170,W10820039VP,PS1485595,EAP1485595.✦W10820039 can Fix The Following Symptoms:①Noisy;②Will not agitate;③Leaking;④Pumps but will not spin. ✦【SUITABLE FOR TOP BRANDS】-- 𝐅𝐈𝐓 𝐊𝐄𝐍𝐌𝐎𝐑𝐄 [11027032600 11027032601 11027032602 11027032603 11027042602 11027042603 11027052600 11027052601 11027082605 11027086600 11028092700 ] 𝐅𝐈𝐓 𝐖𝐇𝐈𝐑𝐋𝐏𝐎𝐎𝐋 [7MWTW7800XW0 7MWTW8800AW0 WTW6200SW0 WTW6200SW1 WTW6200VW0 WTW6200VW1 WTW6300SB0 WTW6300SG0 WTW6300SG1 WTW7300XW2 WTW6600SW1 ] 𝐅𝐈𝐓 𝐌𝐀𝐘𝐓𝐀𝐆 [MVWB300WQ2 MVWB980BW0 7MMVWB850WL0 7MMVWB950AG0 MTW6300TQ1 MTW6400TQ0 MTW6600TB1 MTW6700TQ0 MVWB400VQ0 MVWB450WQ0 MVWB850YG0 ] 𝐌𝐨𝐫𝐞 𝐜𝐨𝐦𝐩𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐦𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬 𝐚𝐫𝐞 𝐥𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐢𝐧 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐝𝐞𝐬𝐜𝐫𝐢𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧. ✦【ABS PLASTIC & STAINLESS STEEL】-- 280145 hub is located in the center of the mixer and rotates the mixer during the wash cycle. The drive shaft fits into the hub, and grooves in the hub allow it to spin the mixer. W10820039 280145 Hubs are made from sturdy STAINLESS STEEL that arigorously manufactured to ensure a long service life. The driver hub featuresa metal ring to tighten connection and increase endurance. The high quality material makes W10820039 washer hub kit more wear-resistant and prevents cracking. ✦【BRING CONVENIENCE TO YOUR LIFE】-- Before replacing the W10820039 hub kit, disconnect the power source and water source from your washingmachine before beginning any repair. You’ll just need a small flathead screwdriver, 7/16-in, socket with a long extension, and towels. Use the towels to cover the drain holes to prevent the screws. If you're not sure how to install it,you can learn from the YouTube,there are more details on it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613oLhVmphL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B08G8JYLNX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-141544","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G8JYLNX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G8JYLNX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
