window.products.push({"id":141582,"name":"COSTWAY 105 Quart Car Travel Freezer, Portable 2-door Compressor Freezer -0.4°F to 50°F, Cooler Mini Fridge, Compact Vehicle Refrigerator for Car, RV,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Tnuzk1YDL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Description: This portable vehicle refrigerator with compressor offers premium quality and innovative design to your frozen/refrigerated needs, which is perfect for home and office use as well as for RVs, yachts, campsites. It can keep your drinks, fruits, meat, and vegetables cool and improve your quality of life. And it has fast cooling mode and energy saving mode. The LCD display screen can control temperature accurately for you. Conveniently plugs into standard home outlets and 12V car chargers so you can take with you anywhere you go. Note: The Right Zone must always be set to an equal or cooler temperature than the Left Zone.WARNING: Required battery: Rated capacity 144Ah(518Wh),Output current 10A Features: With a large capacity of 105 Quarts for storing 100 bottles of 350ml beverage or 40 bottles of 750ml red wineTwo separately controlled temperature zones can be set either zone as a freezer and the other as a refrigeratorTwo durable metal handles on both side for easy movingIt has Max (fast cooling) mode and Min (energy saving) modeAdjustable temperature control to select your desired temperatureWorking sound of the refrigerator is less than 45db 3 different levels for battery protection to protect your vehicle battery With LCD display and digitized temperature adjustment Internal LED lights allow for easier, more convenient access in low-light conditions Specifications: Material: SPCCRated Power: 85W（﹢20%）Refrigerant: R134a/95 ±0.5gCapacity: 100L/105 Quarts Cooling Range: -0.4°F ~ 50°FVoltage: 12V/24V(DC),110-240V(AC)Average Consumption: 0.25kwh/24hrsDoor Style: Double DoorInterior Light: YesNoise：≤45dBOverall Dimension: 34\"(L) x 20.5\"(W) x 23'' (H)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Tnuzk1YDL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B07VPDJQ5Y","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-141582","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VPDJQ5Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VPDJQ5Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":141583,"name":"Newair Nugget Ice Maker, Sonic Speed Countertop Crunchy Ice Pellet Machine 45 lbs. of Ice a Day, Stainless Steel, Self-Cleaning Function and BPA-Free ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DYk0GV3xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Newair 45lb. Nugget Countertop Ice Maker with Self-Cleaning Function There are many commercial nugget ice makers out there, but they cost thousands of dollars and don’t fit seamlessly into the home. We designed the Newair Nugget Ice Maker to be compact, so you can get the crunchy ice you crave right from your kitchen counter. Not only does it blend perfectly into your lifestyle, but our Nugget Ice Maker is the fastest home model on the market. Get the first nuggets of the “good ice” in just 10 minutes. 1. The “Good Ice” Has Never Tasted So Good The nugget ice you love has never tasted crunchier or more satisfying to chew. The Newair nugget ice is smaller than a sugar cube, but just as delightfully soft. It’s the snowy pellets that instantly chill your drinks. Someone with pica, or who simply loves to chew nugget ice, knows that this crunchy ice is hard to find. Curb your cravings from home with an ice maker that gives you your favorite ice in an instant. 2. Fastest Nugget Ice Maker on the Market Most compact ice makers take 15-20 minutes to start producing ice cubes. We designed the Newair Nugget Ice Maker with a high-power cooling process to make it more efficient and faster than any other model on the market. Get the first nuggets in just 10 minutes. 3. Keep the Crunchy Ice Insulated and Ready to Enjoy An extra-thick wall keeps the crunchy Newair ice colder-for-longer for unmatched ice retention. Our Nugget Ice Maker makes sure the “good ice” stays the “good ice”, so it is ready to enjoy when you are. 4. Pure Ice Every Time Our nugget ice maker comes with a simple-to-use, self-cleaning function. It is also built from BPA-free parts to make quality ice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DYk0GV3xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NewAir","source_asin":"B09XBPXFVB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-141583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XBPXFVB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XBPXFVB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
