window.products.push({"id":141621,"name":"COSTWAY Countertop Ice Maker, S/L Size Ice Cubes Ready in 6 Mins, 35LBS/24H Portable and Compact Ice Maker Machine with Self-Cleaning Function, Electr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Yn8D46a1L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧊 [Efficient & Quiet Ice Making] Equipped with a high-quality compressor, our electric ice maker takes only 6-8 minutes to make 9 ice cubes and is able to produce 35 lbs ice per day. Meanwhile, it dissipates heat efficiently and runs at a low noise level of less than 45dB, which will not disturb you at all. 🧊 [Two Ice Sizes Available] The countertop ice making machine can make bullet-shaped ice cubes that are not easier to melt or stick than ordinary ice cubes. According to your preference, you can choose small or large ice cube size to make smoothies, chill drinks, cold seafood and more. 🧊 [Self-Cleaning Function] You just need to press the “On/Off” button for a few seconds to activate the function. The cleaning process takes about 30 minutes. It can clean all corners of the ice machine through water circulation, which offers you and your family fresh ice cubes and saves you a lot of time. 🧊 [Portable Design for Various Occasions] This compact ice maker weighs only 24.5 lbs and measures 11” x 16” x 13.5”(L x W x H) in size, allowing you to carry it to any place with ease. Apart from using it at home, it’s also very suitable for your office, dormitory, RV, party, etc. 🧊 [Convenient to Use] The smart touch control panel is easy to operate. Besides, our electric countertop ice maker is designed with infrared sensors. When the water tank is empty or the ice basket is full, the water shortage indicator and ice full indicator on the panel will remind you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Yn8D46a1L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B0B5F28W93","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-141621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5F28W93","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5F28W93","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
