window.products.push({"id":141745,"name":"MMOBIEL Dryer Thermal Fuse 3392519 Compatible with Whirlpool or Kenmore WP3392519 Replaces Part # AP6008325 3388651 694511","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41p6z0fGZSS._SL1000_.jpg","description":"Replacement Part Number: Thermal Fuse for 3388651, G4AP0500, 3392519, 694511, 80005, WP3392519VP, WP3392519, 21900, 214500, 39800, AP6008325, AP3132867, PS11741460 and PS345113 replacement parts. Perfect fit as a replacement Thermal Fuse for your dryer. Compatibility: Replacement Made to fit exactly for most Top Named Dryers such as: Whirlpool, Kenmore, KitchenAid, Roper, Estate, Inglis, Crosley, Maytag, Amana, Admiral, Magic Chef) Optimal Protection: The role of the thermal fuse is to prevent fires by detecting when the dryer drum is overheating. The dryer will stop running. A thermal fuse is a one-time use part, and are inexpensive and easy to replace. The thermal fuse is just 1 or 2 inches long and should be located on the exhaust duct, but the location of the exhaust duct itself may differ depending on the model. Easy to install: Very easy to install, you do not need a Technician to do it Product provided by MMOBIEL - We always try our best to exceed your expectations at every turn. Join the ever growing list of satisfied customers and discover the difference with MMOBIEL.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41p6z0fGZSS._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MMOBIEL","source_asin":"B09924LJC2","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-141745","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09924LJC2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09924LJC2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
