window.products.push({"id":141776,"name":"279838 Dryer Heating Element, 3977767 3392519 Dryer Thermostat kit, LIYYOO Dryer Heating Element Kit, Compatible with whirlpool, kenmore, roper, mayta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.56,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ffp663OmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"279838 Dryer Heating Element Assembly Replacement Part:This element is rated at 5400 Watts 240 Volts and has 2- 5/16\" male terminals. The 279838 Dryer heating element employs a coiled wire made of nickel and a chrome alloy. The coiled wire on the heating coil receives and resists the controlled current, causing the wire to heat and blow into the drum to dry the laundry.Heating element replacement for numbers: 279837, 279838, 279838A, 279838VP, 3398064 3403585, 8565582, AP3094254, W10724237  3977767 Dryer Heating Element Kit,The thermal acts as safety mechanism that keeps the dryer from overheating.The thermal fuse replace part number is 3399693, WP3977767VP, AP3131941, 898078.  3392519 Dryer Heating Element Kit,The thermal fuse is used in dryer as a safety mechanism that stops the flow of electricity to the motor circuit when a dryer overheats.When this fuse is faulty, your dryer will not start or it will not heat properly. The thermal fuse replace part number is 3388651, 3392519, 694511, 80005, WP3392519VP. When your dryer has these symptoms, you may need to replace the dryer heating element Kit:  No heating or not enough heating, too hot to dry too long. Product features: Made from durable high quality material for long lasting and 100% well-tested,Exceed OEM Requirements!  Fit most top dryer brands:Compatible with Whirlpool, Kenmore, Maytag, KitchenAid, Roper Dryer, Crosley, Estate, Amana, Inglis, Admiral, Magic Chef, Jenn-Air.  Cheap Price,Save money:Don't spend hundreds of dollars replacing your dryer when all you need is a kit of replacement parts,Save a lot of money and time.  Easy to install. Package Includes: 1 x 279838 Dryer Heating Element  1 x 3977767 Dryer Thermostat  1 x 3392519 Thermal Fuse Please check your old part against the picture to make sure this parts will fits on your Washer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ffp663OmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIYYOO","source_asin":"B08MDQJ2XZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-141776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MDQJ2XZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MDQJ2XZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
