window.products.push({"id":141957,"name":"Brynnl 8pcs Christmas Refrigerator Door Handle Covers Set, Gnome Kitchen Appliance Handle Covers Set, Kitchen Appliance for Christmas Decorations, Clo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sx88qiwnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High-Quality】Christmas handle covers is made of linen, comfortable to the touch, anti-static and non-slip, durable, easy to clean and reusable. It can effectively protect your equipment from being too cold or overheating. Can be used to decorate home appliances such as ovens, refrigerators, and microwave ovens. 【Unique Christmas Design】The fridge cover is based on red and black plaid as a whole, with a cute and interesting image of Santa Claus and buttons embellishment. Exquisitely made and has a texture to make your house full of festive atmosphere. Suitable for Christmas-themed home decoration. 【Easy to Install and Use】Each handle cover has an adjustable 0.8inch wide tape, which can be adjusted according to the thickness of your handle. You only need to put the cover on the handle of the appliance and stick the tape. Fridge cover handle set can be combined arbitrarily to protect the handles of your electrical appliances from fingerprints and stains. Play a role in dustproof, prevent friction, easy to use, install and remove. 【Suitable for All Kitchen Appliances】Christmas handle covers is very suitable for your household kitchen appliances, you can easily put them on the handles of refrigerators, ovens, closets, microwave ovens, dishwashers and other appliances to protect the appliances. During Christmas, you can use these handle covers to decorate appliances and increase the Christmas atmosphere, which is very suitable for giving to family and friends. 【What You Will Get】Fridge cover handle set includes 4 handle sets including four long sets and 4 short sets. The size of the long sleeve is 38*13cm/15*5.1in, and the size of the short sleeve is 20*13cm/7.9*5.1in. The cute christmas fridge handle covers design brings a festival atmosphere to your kitchen, and you can enjoy a lot of fun.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sx88qiwnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brynnl","source_asin":"B0B6J12BRN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-141957","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6J12BRN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6J12BRN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":141958,"name":"Waterdrop 847200 Refrigerator Water Filter Replacement for Fisher & Paykel Water Filter 847200","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hMJ66mDbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Replacement for model] Fisher & Paykel 847200, Fisher & Paykel Refrigerator model number starting with E522, E422, E402 and the product code on the filter starts with a 25xxx. This filter is replacement for Fisher & Paykel 847200 refrigerator water filter, despite the affordable price, offer the best - a mix of prior filtration performance and important certifications from the well-known regulatory body in the industry – NSF 42 and NSF 372 certificates. Thanks to the 100% Sri Lankan superior coconut shell carbon block, this replacement for Fisher & Paykel 847200 water filter can effective against various contaminants. [Perfect fit] You can now worry less about water leakages due to unfit or loose replacement refrigerator filters. This Waterdrop refrigerator filter replacement is made from an advanced industrial automation system and a precision measurement technology that ensures that you get the same fit as the original. Moreover, you need no tool to install this refrigerator water filter. Just follow the installation guidelines we have provided, and you will be done in minutes. Top-notch filter material: Here, you are getting a significant improvement to the less-efficient charcoal filter that relies on coal, wood, walnut shell, and apricot shell to filter water. The filter material in this filter is a 100% Sri Lankan selected coconut shell carbon block, with 2x larger surface area and more micropores. [Fresh-tasting water] The 100% coconut shell carbon block can adsorb more impurities than low-priced and mixed carbon block. The Waterdrop refrigerator filter significantly improves the taste of drinking water to bring you a unique experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hMJ66mDbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B079SCSSV6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-141958","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079SCSSV6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B079SCSSV6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
